    },
    {
      "severity": "Major",
      "cost": "S",
      "name": "Same rounded pointer size and release repeatedly allocate identical output",
      "evidence": "One public512x384→2048x1536 trace: first move,3subpixel same-rounded moves and release each construct12,582,912B output. Five requests62,914,560B cumulative; repeated callback costs127–141ms before.",
